==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[limacon]] (without the [[cedilla]])

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|limaçon|lang=fr}}, ultimately from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|limax||snail|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{geometry}} A [[plane curve]] with [[polar equation]] <math>\rho = a + b\,\sin\,\theta</math> or <math>\rho = a + b\,\cos\,\theta</math>, of which the [[cardioid]] is a special case.

====Synonyms====
* [[limaçon of Pascal]]

